# Armed-hook registrations. `lasso-guard.sh install` and `lasso-verify.sh
# install` write an absolute path to the hook script, which is correct for the
# machine that ran it and wrong for everyone else. Arming is a deliberate
# per-project step, documented in the README; it is not something a clone
# should inherit.
